+# Feature Specification: Long-Stay Discount
+
+**Created**: 2026-11-17 | **Status**: Implemented
+**Input**: Reward customers who stay longer. A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price. Quotes and bookings both show the reduced total.
+
+## Requirements
+- **FR-001**: A rental of 3 or more whole days has total = full price (days × daily price) minus 10%.
+- **FR-002**: Rentals of 1 or 2 days are unchanged.
+- **FR-003**: `quote` and `book` return the same reduced total (`book` reuses the quote).
+- **FR-004**: Totals stay integer euro cents.
+
+## Open question (resolved by assumption)
+- The request does not say how to round a 10% discount that is not a whole number of cents. **Assumption**: the reduced total is rounded to the nearest cent, halves up (`round(full × 9 / 10)`, computed in integers). To be confirmed by the school.
+
+## Plan / Tasks
+- Name the rule in `src/index.ts` (`LONG_STAY_MIN_DAYS`, `rentalTotal`) and use it in `price`.
+- Add tests in `test/rental.test.ts`: 2 days (no discount), 3 days (boundary), longer, rounding, booking total.
